{
  "uid": "telemetry-journey",
  "title": "Distributed Journey",
  "description": "One request across Go, Rust, Python, C++ and TypeScript services: its trace, every service's logs for it, and the metrics around it.",
  "tags": [
    "telemetry",
    "tracing",
    "logging",
    "metrics"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "trace",
        "label": "trace",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "description": "A trace id: the dashboard shows that trace and its logs. Empty shows every checkout's logs."
      },
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "service",
        "type": "custom",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "orders-go|inventory-rs|billing-py|shipping-cpp|notify-ts",
        "query": "orders-go,inventory-rs,billing-py,shipping-cpp,notify-ts",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "All",
            "value": "$__all",
            "selected": true
          },
          {
            "text": "orders-go",
            "value": "orders-go",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "inventory-rs",
            "value": "inventory-rs",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "billing-py",
            "value": "billing-py",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "shipping-cpp",
            "value": "shipping-cpp",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "notify-ts",
            "value": "notify-ts",
            "selected": false
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**One checkout, five services, five languages.** `orders-go` \u2192 `inventory-rs` \u2192 `billing-py` \u2192 `shipping-cpp` \u2192 `notify-ts`, each step a span, each step's logs carrying its trace and span id. Pick a checkout in **Recent checkouts** (or paste a trace id into `trace`) to see its whole trace and every service's logs for it. Run one with `TELEMETRY_DEMO_OTLP=localhost:6009 just crosslang`."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Journey",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Checkouts",
      "description": "Checkouts orders-go started: its checkout spans.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(traces_calls_total{service_name=\"orders-go\", span_name=\"checkout\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Stock reserved",
      "description": "Orders inventory-rs reserved stock for: its inventory.reserve spans.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(traces_calls_total{service_name=\"inventory-rs\", span_name=\"inventory.reserve\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Payments",
      "description": "Charges billing-py made: its billing.charge spans.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(traces_calls_total{service_name=\"billing-py\", span_name=\"billing.charge\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
